	"_note": "Terrain presets (TerrainPresets, ZoneTerrain, ZoneScatter). A zone's preset: its def's \"terrain\", else the first name_hints entry whose word is in the zone's name, else region_defaults[region], else \"default\". To add one: add an entry under \"presets\" (every key is optional, see the docs in docs/terrain_presets.md), then name it from a zone (\"terrain\" in its def) or a hint/region default. land: relief_scale multiplies the def's relief_m; wavelength_m/octaves/gain shape the noise; ridge 0..1 mixes in sharp ridged noise; flatten > 1 flattens low relief (plains with the odd bump); offset_m lifts or sinks the whole land. wadi: dry riverbeds carved across the zone. sea: a shoreline along one side picked by the seed (never a side that holds a module, insertion or extraction point). palette: ground colours. scatter: items per km2 of zone (counts grow with the zone's area), capped by ZoneScatter's limits.",
